      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Rendered as a painted fantasy illustration for a tabletop roleplaying game rulebook: a detailed digital painting with the look of traditional oil on canvas, confident visible brushwork, edges that soften away from the focal point, rich texture in cloth, leather, metal and stone.\nPalette: rich, natural and slightly warm - earthy browns, deep crimson, old gold, forest green and slate blue - with one strong accent colour and deep, soft shadows.\nLighting: dramatic directional light with a clear key light and warm rim light, atmospheric haze and depth, glowing magical light only where magic is present.\nComposition: cinematic, one clear focal point, strong silhouette, a sense of scale and adventure.\nEvery person is fully clothed in period fantasy dress. No nudity.\nNo text, no letters, no words, no typography, no captions, no watermark, no signature, no logos, no border, no frame, no UI elements. Not a photograph, not a 3D render, not anime, not cartoon, not flat vector art, no neon."
      ],
      "title": "HOUSE_STYLE (shared by every book-art workflow)"
    },
